; DESCRIPTION:
;-------------------------------------------------
; Pulse sequence for INADEQUATE-type DQ/SQ correlation experiment
;   using super-cycled R symmetry sequence (SRN_n^nu)
;   where SRN_n^nu = (RN_n^nu)_0 (RN_n^-nu)_0 (RN_n^-nu)_pi (RN_n^nu)_pi
;   and the R element is (90)_0 (270)_180
;   States acquisition in the indirect dimension
;   With cross polarization from F2 to F1,
;   presaturation on F2, shaped pulse on F2 for CP,
;   composite pulse decoupling during acquisition and evolution
; For AVANCE AQS spectrometer
;************ IMPORTANT *************
; Set parmod = 2D, mc2 = STATES
;************************************
