;cnst0 : small phase correction for R element
;cnst31 : spinning frequency (in Hz)
;l1 : N symmetry number (= 26)
;l2 : _n symmetry number (= 4)
;l3 : nu symmetry number (= 11)
;p11 : length of R element 90 pulse
;p12 : length of R element 270 pulse
