;pl14 : R sequence decoupling power (F2) (> 3*nu_1(X))
;l11 : excitation: no. pairs of R elements (see d11)
;l12 : reconversion: no. pairs of R elements (see d12)
;d11 : length of excitation period
;d12 : length of reconversion period
;d10 : Z-filter delay
;d31 : rotor period

;d0 : first evolution delay (=1u)
;cpdprg3 : evolution decoupling sequence (F2)
;pl13 : evolution decoupling power (F2)
